<title>CANADA: Biovail approved for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Biovail approved for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biovail Corp International said on Monday its common stock was approved for listing on the New York Stock Exchange and that it expected its shares to begin trading on December 12 under the symbol &quot;BVF&quot;.</p>
<p>Biovail said it had about 25.4 million common shares outstanding, which were traded on the Toronto and American Stock Exchanges.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
